{"id":"bisschen","lemma":"bisschen","pos":"adv","rank":265,"glosses":["(a) bit; (a) little","(not a) bit"],"ipa":"/ˈbɪsçən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a5/De-bisschen.ogg/De-bisschen.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich bin ein bisschen betrunken.","en":"I am a bit drunk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/41869","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"drunk, inebriated"}]},{"text":"Gib mir ein bisschen Geld.","en":"Give me a little money.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698694","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"money"}]},{"text":"Kann ich ein bisschen davon essen?","en":"May I eat a little of it?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593021","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"from it"},{"g":"to eat"}]},{"text":"Könntest du ein bisschen helfen?","en":"Could you help a bit?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Kannst du ein bisschen Platz machen?","en":"Can you make some room?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/701230","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"square, plaza, piazza"},{"g":"to make"}]}]}